.claude/worktrees/

# Python bytecode. 61 .pyc files were tracked across risk_premium_pca/ and
# farming_anthropic_ipo_volatility/ before this rule existed. Stale committed
# bytecode shadows deleted modules on checkout, so an import can succeed on a
# machine where the source is gone — a failure that reproduces for one person
# and not another.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
